andle <code>status=failed</code> as a job failure, even when the polling HTTP status is <code>200</code>.</p><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-dark github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B392F0;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">curl</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> -fS</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> &quot;https://api.voicelab.uz/v1/stt/transcriptions/</span><span style="--shiki-light:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">$STT_JOB_ID</span><span style="--shiki-light:#9ECBFF;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \</span></span>
