</code></td><td>Wait for <code>Retry-After</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:right;"><code>503</code></td><td><code>stt_unavailable</code></td><td>Retry later with the same idempotency key</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></main><footer class="VPDocFooter" data-v-fd2f0f74 data-v-c4f9bca8><!--[--><!--]--><div class="edit-info" data-v-c4f9bca8><!----><div class="last-updated" data-v-c4f9bca8><p class="VPLastUpdated" data-v-c4f9bca8 data-v-ce225365>Updated: <time datetime="2026-11-06T12:22:44.000Z" data-v-ce225365></time></p></div></div><nav class="prev-next" aria-labelledby="doc-footer-aria-label" data-v-c4f9bca8><span class="visually-hidden" id="doc-footer-aria-label" data-v-c4f9bca8>Pager</span><div class="pager" data-v-c4f9bca8><a class="VPLink link pager-link prev" href="/api/voice-cloning" data-v-c4f9bca8><!--[--><span class="desc" data-v-c4f9bca8>Previous</span><span class="title" data-v-c4f9bca8>Voice Cloning</span><!--]--></a></div><div class="pager" data-v-c4f9bca8><a class="VPLink link pager-link next" href="/api/realtime-stt" data-v-c4f9bca8><!--[--><span class="desc" data-v-c4f9bca8>Next</span><span class="title" data-v-c4f9bca8><span class="sidebar-endpoint"><span class="sidebar-method sidebar-method--wss">WSS</span><span class="sidebar-endpoint__label">Realtime</span></span></span><!--]--></a></div></nav></footer><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div><!--[--><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div>
